<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-CSX, Norfolk raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSX, Norfolk raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst James Valentine upgraded CSX Corp and Norfolk Southern Corp to buy from hold, citing their agreement to divide Conrail Inc.</p>
<p>-- Cut Conrail to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Set two-year price target of $61-64 for CSX, for 38 percent to 44 percent upside. Set two-year price target of $102-109 for Norfolk, for 17 percent to 25 percent upside.</p>
<p>-- Said CSX and Norfolk both appear attractive &quot;especially for investors who can look out 2-3 years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- CSX rose 3/4 to 45, Norfolk rose 1/2 to 87-3/8 and Conrail rose 1/4 to 113-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
